      "name": "🇺🇦 Chlorophyll-a Sentinel-2 — Dnipro Reservoir",
      "description": "Chlorophyll-a (CHL) time series derived from Sentinel-2 over the Dnipro reservoir, Ukraine. Processed from Terrascope/VITO, stored as COGs in Azure Blob Storage.",
